<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan weekly forex reserves rise to $1.461 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan weekly forex reserves rise to $1.461 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the weekly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan, in billions of dollars.</p>
<p>				  JAN 2	DEC 26   JAN 4, 1995</p>
<p> TOTAL			  1.461	 1.182    2.405</p>
<p> Forex in Pakistan	  0.409	 0.409    1.472</p>
<p> Forex outside Pakistan   0.363	 0.084    0.214</p>
<p> Gold coins and bullion   0.676	 0.676    0.707</p>
<p> Special Drawing Rights   0.013	 0.013    0.012</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
